References to SAB Biotherapeutics, Inc.

In this Annual Report, unless otherwise stated or the context otherwise indicates, references to the “Company,” “SAB,” “SAB BIO,” “we,” “our” and “us” mean SAB Biotherapeutics, Inc., a Delaware corporation, and its consolidated subsidiaries.

